<title>COLOMBIA: TABLE - Colombia's Cementos Diamante H1 net down.</title>
<headline>TABLE - Colombia's Cementos Diamante H1 net down.</headline>
<dateline>BOGOTA 1997-07-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Colombian cement manufacturer Cementos Diamante, controlled by Mexican cement giant Cemex reported the following first half results:</p>
<p>		First half 1997		  First half 1996</p>
<p>Shr	   146.27			     N/A</p>
<p>Net profit  15.9 billion	    profit 18.69 billion</p>
<p>Oper profit 49.33 billion	     loss    225 million</p>
<p>NOTE: All figures in Colombian pesos.</p>
<p>((-- Karl Penhaul, Bogota newsroom, 571 610 7944))</p>
